 pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"bestloot3\"><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Terra Hood\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Terra_Hood_7ac145.gif\" width=\"32\"/></span></span></td>\n<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"bestloot4\"><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Guardian Shield\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Guardian_Shield_1a3c3e.gif\" width=\"32\"/></span></span></td>\n<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"bestloot5\"><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Scarab Shield\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Scarab_Shield_abc57f.gif\" width=\"32\"/></span></span></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Other Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"implemented\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Version</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"implementation-date\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Updates%2F10.70\">10.70</a><br/>December 10, 2014<br/>Winter Update 2014</span></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<nav class=\"pi-navigation pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-font\"><p>\t    See also: Hunting Places <span class=\"explained\">Help</span></p></nav>\n</aside>\n<p>The <b>Lion's Rock</b> is an area north-west of <a href=\"#/wiki/Darashia\">Darashia</a>. \n</p><p>There is a series of riddles within the dungeon, the reward of which can yield the <a href=\"#/wiki/Noble%20Lion%20%28Mount%29\">Noble Lion</a> taming item.\n</p><p><br/>\nThe <a href=\"#/quest/lions-rock-quest\">Lion's Rock Quest</a> is located here.\n</p><p><br/>\nSome creatures here are unblockable spawns, like the <a href=\"#/wiki/Pharaohs\">Pharaohs</a> or <a href=\"#/wiki/Demon%20Forge\">Demon Forge</a> bosses. The strongest creature on the first level is the <a href=\"#/wiki/Bonebeast\">Bonebeast</a>. There are only 4-5 of them. <a href=\"#/wiki/Ancient%20Scarab\">Ancient Scarabs</a> and <a href=\"#/wiki/Roaring%20Lion\">Roaring Lions</a> are only on lower levels. And they are the only creatures there. Be careful on lower levels, as <a href=\"#/wiki/Ancient%20Scarab\">Ancient Scarabs</a> spawn fast and can paralyze and block you. <a href=\"#/wiki/Roaring%20Lion\">Roaring Lions</a> are easier to kill, because they do not poison or paralyze you, like the <a href=\"#/wiki/Ancient%20Scarab\">Ancient Scarabs</a> does.\n</p>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Creatures\">Creatures</span></h2>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div><table cellspacing=\"0\" class=\"wikitable sortable full-width\"><tbody><tr><th>Name</th><th data-sort-type=\"number\" style=\"width: 38px; text-align: center;\">Exp</th><th data-sort-type=\"number\" style=\"text-align: center;\">HP</th><th data-sort-type=\"number\" style=\"text-align: center;\">Max. Damage</th><th style=\"font-size: small;\">Loot</th></tr>\n<tr><td style=\"width: 100px; text-align: center\"><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Cobra\"><img alt=\"Cobra\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"64\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Cobra_cbac54.gif\" width=\"64\"/></a></span></span><br/><a href=\"#/wiki/Cobra\">Cobra</a></td><td style=\"width: 38px; text-align: center;\">30</td><td style=\"text-align: center;\">65</td><td style=\"text-align: center;\">5</td><td style=\"font-size: small;\"><div class=\"loot-table\" id=\"w-loot_perc_loot\">\n<ul><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Cobra%20Tongue\">Cobra Tongue</a> (semi-rare)</li>\n</ul>\n</div></td></tr><tr><td style=\"width: 100px; text-align: center\"><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Larva\"><img alt=\"Larva\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Larva_cda9ab.gif\" width=\"32\"/></a></span></span><br/><a href=\"#/wiki/Larva\">Larva</a></td><td style=\"width: 38px; text-align: center;\">44</td><td style=\"text-align: center;\">70</td><td style=\"text-align: center;\">36 (<span style=\"white-space: nowrap\">35 <span class=\"icon\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Physical%20Damage\"><img alt=\"Physical Damage\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"9\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Physical_Damage_Icon_356411.gif\" width=\"9\"/></a></span></span></span>, <span style=\"white-space: nowrap\">1 <span class=\"icon\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Earth Damage\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"9\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Poisoned_Icon_7605e0.gif\" width=\"9\"/></span></span></span>)</td><td style=\"font-size: small;\"><div class=\"loot-table\" id=\"w-loot_perc_loot\">\n<ul><li>0-15× <a href=\"#/wiki/Gold%20Coin\">Gold Coin</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Meat\">Meat</a></li>\n</ul>\n</div></td></tr><tr><td style=\"width: 100px; text-align: center\"><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Scorpion\"><img alt=\"Scorpion\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Scorpion_20081f.gif\" width=\"32\"/></a></span></span><br/><a href=\"#/wiki/Scorpion\">Scorpion</a></td><td style=\"width: 38px; text-align: center;\">45</td><td style=\"text-align: center;\">45</td><td style=\"text-align: center;\">67</td><td style=\"font-size: small;\"><div class=\